{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/82200-american-mcgee-s-alice","id":82200,"title":"American McGee's Alice","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-01T11:57:44-08:00","id":82200,"title":"American McGee's Alice","content":"I don't know if there was a prompt about this on the old forum or not, but if there was it's long gone now. So, has anyone played these games and/or incorporated them into Changeling? Or does anyone just have some good ideas?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1664-thornfield13713","name":"Thornfield13713","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-01T12:17:56-08:00","id":82211,"title":"","content":"There was something in the old forums, anyway.<br /> <br /> My personal view is that Alice is just a regular mortal with the Lucid Dreaming merit. If she was a Changeling and the books were her Durance, well I don't like the no-Seeming Merit but if it ever fit it was here, alternatively a Fairest Maiden (it dosn't exist, I'm sure you can figure it out <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ). If the games were her durance. Undoubtedly an Ogre, Gargantuan, maybe Gargantuan/LittleFolk or Gargantuan/Bloodbrute who uses Contracts of Mirror to shrink.<br /> <br /> Either way check the index in my sig for Dream Deprogramming.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-01T12:27:11-08:00","id":82224,"title":"","content":"One thing about Alice in Wonderland themed games (or Peter Pan themed games, since <s>I like Peter Pan better</s> it has a lot of similar themes and a similar set up that suits Changeling), is that obviously the fun is in having the character types wandering around where people will interact with them.<br /> <br /> Another thing is that holy moly is Alice in Wonderland popular.<br /> <br /> I like to imagine there are a lot of different &quot;wonderlands&quot; scattered throughout Arcadia. A lot of Alices, a lot of White Rabbits, a lot of Queens of Hearts. Actually, it's possible that there are wonderlands where the True Fae is the Alice, and collects Cheshire cats and march hares and mad hatters to populate it's &quot;dreams&quot;. After all, with so many Alice in Wonderland motifs, I imagine some True Fae just want to be the star of an Alice in Wonderland story, right?<br /> <br /> So something I've been toying around (and might consider making a PbP game for when I have more time) with is a Changeling Freehold populated by Alice in Wonderland characters from a variety of Wonderlands. Queen of Hearts could be Fairest, or Ogres, or blood themed Elementals. White Rabbits are clearly Beasts -- unless they're also rabbit themed messengers, where they might be harried wizened or forever busy fairest. The Mad Hatter may be a wizened recluse or he might be a manikin elemental or he might be a darkling who killed Time and was trapped in a land where it was forever teatime.<br /> <br /> I wouldn't stick to one particular Alice in Wonderland, but draw inspiration from as many versions as possible to reflect how ingrained they are in pop culture.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2230-murder-chan","name":"Murder-chan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-04T12:48:33-08:00","id":84143,"title":"","content":"All I know is that that dollhouse board creeped me the hell out and I'd like to do <i>something</i> with it (or something similar) in my game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1912-vorzakk","name":"Vorzakk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1912_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}